      "location": "Page title at top center, y~80-120.",
      "fact": "Bold black serif title reads 'City Emissions Reduction by Program'. The y-axis label at upper left, y~160-180, reads 'Reported reduction share (%)'. The y-axis scale runs from 0 to 70 in increments of 5, with tick labels at x~140-160. Five vertical bars are arranged left-to-right along the x-axis, each with a bold percentage annotation above it. The bars have distinct colors: green (leftmost), light blue (second), purple-blue (middle), dark green (fourth), and brown (rightmost). The light blue bar (second from left) is the tallest, reaching near the 70 mark. The green bar (first) is the second tallest, reaching just above 40. The purple-blue bar (third) reaches just above 50. The dark green bar (fourth) is the shortest, reaching just above 20. The brown bar (fifth) reaches just above 35. The x-axis labels are positioned below each bar at y~900-960."
    }
  ],
  "printed_facts": [
    {
      "location": "Y-axis label at upper left, y~160-180.",
      "fact": "The y-axis is labeled 'Reported reduction share (%)'. The scale is linear from 0 to 70, with major ticks at 0, 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30, 35, 40, 45, 50, 55, 60, 65, 70. The x-axis labels, from left to right, are: 'Building retrofits', 'Transit electrification', 'Industrial efficiency', 'Tree canopy', 'Methane capture'. The data labels above the bars, from left to right, are: '41.2%', '29.8%', '18.5%', '7.2%', '3.3%'. The bar for 'Building retrofits' (green) has a data label of '41.2%' and its top aligns with the y-axis value of 41.2. The bar for 'Transit electrification' (light blue) has a data label of '29.8%' and its top aligns with the y-axis value of 29.8. The bar for 'Industrial efficiency' (purple-blue) has a data label of '18.5%' and its top aligns with the y-axis value of 18.5. The bar for 'Tree canopy' (dark green) has a data label of '7.2%' and its top aligns with the y-axis value of 7.2. The bar for 'Methane capture' (brown) has a data label of '3.3%' and its top aligns with the y-axis value of 3.3."
    }
  ],
  "public_definitions": [
    "The task requires identifying the 'emissions-reduction program with the largest contribution' from the dashboard. The 'Routing basis' is specified as 'Largest city emissions-reduction contribution program'. The 'Escalation queue' is 'Accelerated program review'. The available options are: 'Route Building retrofits to accelerated program review', 'Route Transit electrification to accelerated program review', and 'Keep Industrial efficiency in routine program monitoring'."
  ],
